			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Restore ActionEffect system and prune dead IPC modules\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to 341634d7.\n\n**Common** (refactor): Restore the Effect module to the public API in Library.rs, re-adding the ActionEffect trait and associated types that power the editor's abstract effect system across Mountain, Cocoon, and other elements. The module was previously removed during a deprecated transport pass but is required as the foundational abstraction.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Remove dead submodules from ApplicationState, IPC, and ProcessManagement layers. Eliminate unused `PathResolution`, `Recovery`, `Serialization` in Internal; `Message`, `Connection`, `Encryption`, `Security`, `WindAirCommands`, `WindServiceAdapters`, and `Permission` in IPC; plus `WorkspaceContainsGlob` in ProcessManagement. Condense module documentation to focused summaries, removing migration roadmaps and legacy notes.\n\nThis realigns the core architecture with the current effect-based design while reducing noise in the module tree to preserve only actively-used code paths.",
			"SHA": "7004371af565b6994acb7528fca745aad62dfcc6"
		},
